#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
pipeguard - look before you pipe.

Static analysis for shell scripts you are about to run with `curl ... | bash`.
It downloads (or reads) a script, flags risky patterns, and - if you choose to
run it - executes the exact bytes it analyzed, never a fresh download.

Zero dependencies: Python 3.8+ standard library only.
License: MIT
"""

